# Weather: Open-Meteo, no key needed — coordinates are set in lib/config.ts.
# Picture of the day: Wikimedia Commons' "Picture of the Day" via Wikipedia's
#           public REST API — no key needed.

# Calendar: server-side only, read by the serverless function
# (netlify/functions/calendar.js on Netlify, api/calendar.js on Vercel) —
# never prefix this with NEXT_PUBLIC_, or it would ship in the client bundle.
#
# Get it from Google Calendar: Settings and sharing (for the specific
# calendar, not general settings) -> Integrate calendar -> "Secret address
# in iCal format". Keeping this private does NOT require making the
# calendar public — that's the whole point of using the secret address
# instead of the public embed.
CALENDAR_ICS_URL=
